  "html": "<a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a><header class=\"premium-nav site-header\" role=\"banner\">\n<div class=\"premium-container premium-nav-inner container\">\n<a aria-label=\"Wishly Guide home\" class=\"brand-lockup\" href=\"/\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"brand-mark\">✦</span>\n<span><b>Wishly</b><small>CREATE MOMENTS</small></span>\n</a>\n<nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\" class=\"premium-nav-links nav-links\" id=\"wishly-guide-navigation\">\n<a href=\"https://wishly.bd/templates/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Templates</a><a href=\"https://wishly.bd/features/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Features</a><a href=\"https://wishly.bd/custom-template/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Custom template</a><a href=\"/guides/\">Guides</a><a aria-current=\"page\" class=\"active\" href=\"/about/\">About</a><a href=\"/authors/ra-fahim/\">Developer</a><a class=\"nav-mobile-link\" href=\"https://wishly.bd/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Main Wishly ↗</a><a class=\"nav-mobile-link nav-mobile-primary\" href=\"https://wishly.bd/create/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Create website →</a>\n</nav>\n<div class=\"premium-nav-actions nav-actions\">\n<div class=\"nav-cta-wrap\"><a class=\"nav-cta\" href=\"https://wishly.bd/create/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Create website <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div>\n<div class=\"wp-wrap\">\n<button aria-controls=\"wishly-account-menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Open account menu\" class=\"wp-trigger is-guest\" data-wg-account-toggle=\"\" type=\"button\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-av\">✦</span>\n<span class=\"wp-label\">Account</span>\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-chev\" fill=\"none\" height=\"15\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"15\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg>\n</button>\n<button aria-label=\"Close account menu\" class=\"wp-scrim\" data-wg-account-scrim=\"\" hidden=\"\" type=\"button\"></button>\n<div class=\"wp-menu\" data-wg-account-menu=\"\" hidden=\"\" id=\"wishly-account-menu\">\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-grab\"></div>\n<div class=\"wp-head\">\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-av\">✦</div>\n<div><strong>Welcome to Wishly</strong><small>Make a personal website for a meaningful moment</small></div>\n<button aria-label=\"Close account menu\" class=\"wp-close\" data-wg-account-close=\"\" type=\"button\">×</button>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-quick\">\n<a class=\"wp-login\" href=\"https://wishly.bd/login/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Log in</a>\n<a class=\"nav-cta\" href=\"https://wishly.bd/signup/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Sign up free <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-explore\">\n<div class=\"wp-group\">Explore Wishly</div>\n<a class=\"wp-row\" href=\"https://wishly.bd/templates/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Templates</b><span class=\"wp-go\">↗</span></a>\n<a class=\"wp-row\" href=\"https://wishly.bd/features/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Features</b><span class=\"wp-go\">↗</span></a>\n<a class=\"wp-row\" href=\"/guides/\"><b>Guides &amp; tutorials</b><span class=\"wp-go\">›</span></a>\n<a class=\"wp-row\" href=\"/guides/create-wish-website/\"><b>How to make a website</b><span class=\"wp-go\">›</span></a>\n<a class=\"wp-row\" href=\"/authors/ra-fahim/\"><b>Meet the developer</b><span class=\"wp-go\">›</span></a>\n<a class=\"wp-row\" href=\"https://wishly.bd/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Main Wishly website</b><span class=\"wp-go\">↗</span></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-rows\"><a class=\"wp-row\" href=\"/contact/\"><b>Contact</b><span class=\"wp-go\">›</span></a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<a class=\"lang-link\" href=\"/bn/\" lang=\"bn\">বাংলা</a>\n<button aria-controls=\"wishly-guide-navigation\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Open navigation menu\" class=\"menu-toggle mobile-nav-toggle\" type=\"button\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><main id=\"main\"><section class=\"page-hero\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"page-heading\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">THE STORY BEHIND THE GUIDE</span><h1>A little more meaning<br/><em>in every moment.</em></h1><p>Wishly Guide is the learning and information space for people exploring personal wish websites. It explains the product, shares practical ideas and helps creators use the tools with confidence.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"section\"><div class=\"container about-grid\"><div class=\"split-copy reveal\"><p class=\"kicker\">WHY THIS EXISTS</p><h2>Technology should help people express <em>what matters.</em></h2><p>Some messages deserve more than a plain text. A birthday wish, a proposal, an apology or a shared memory can become a small digital experience with its own design, words and details.</p><p>Wishly was created around that idea: make it possible for people to build and share personal pages without having to learn web development first.</p><p>This guide exists to make the process easier to understand. It brings together product explanations, practical tutorials, design tips and answers to common questions.</p></div><div class=\"founder-card reveal delay-1\"><img alt=\"RA Fahim, developer and creator behind Wishly\" class=\"founder-photo\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/editorial/ra-fahim-developer-wishly.webp\" width=\"540\"/><h3>Built by RA Fahim</h3><p>Wishly was created by web developer and solo founder RA Fahim, with the goal of making personal digital experiences easier for everyone to create and share.</p><a href=\"/authors/ra-fahim/\">Read developer profile ↗</a>   <a href=\"https://rafahim.com/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Portfolio ↗</a></div></div></section><section class=\"section section-white\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-head center reveal\"><p class=\"kicker\">WHAT WE BELIEVE</p><h2>Personal first.<br/><em>Technology second.</em></h2><p>The best tools stay out of the way and make it easier for people to focus on the message they want to share.</p></div><div class=\"steps-grid\"><article class=\"step-card reveal\"><span class=\"step-number\">01</span><h3>Make it approachable</h3><p>A person should not need to understand HTML, CSS or JavaScript to start with a thoughtful template and personalize it.</p></article><article class=\"step-card reveal delay-1\"><span class=\"step-number\">02</span><h3>Leave room for individuality</h3><p>Different people and occasions call for different colors, words, media and interactions. The result should feel personal.</p></article><article class=\"step-card reveal delay-2\"><span class=\"step-number\">03</span><h3>Make sharing simple</h3><p>A published page should be easy to open in a browser and straightforward to share with a link.</p></article></div></div></section><section class=\"section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"cta-band reveal\"><div><h2>Discover what you can create.</h2><p>Visit Wishly to explore the templates and make a page of your own.</p></div><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://wishly.bd/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Visit Wishly ↗</a></div></div></section></main><footer class=\"site-footer hp-foot\">\n<div class=\"premium-container\">\n<div class=\"hp-foot-row footer-main-row\">\n<div class=\"hp-foot-brand\">\n<a aria-label=\"Wishly Guide home\" class=\"brand-lockup brand\" href=\"/\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"brand-mark\">✦</span><span class=\"brand-lockup-copy\"><b>Wishly</b><small>GUIDE · CREATE MOMENTS</small></span>\n</a>\n<p>Ideas, practical tutorials and clear answers for creating personal websites that make life’s special moments feel even more memorable.</p>\n<a class=\"premium-button premium-button-ghost footer-main-cta\" href=\"https://wishly.bd/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Main Wishly website ↗</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"footer-link-group\"><h4>Explore</h4><a href=\"/guides/\">All guides</a><a href=\"/topics/love-and-romance/\">Love &amp; romance</a><a href=\"/topics/emotional-support/\">Emotional support</a><a href=\"/topics/communication-and-repair/\">Communication &amp; repair</a><a href=\"/topics/long-distance-relationships/\">Long-distance</a><a href=\"/topics/special-occasions/\">Special occasions</a><a href=\"/topics/friendship-and-gratitude/\">Friendship &amp; gratitude</a><a href=\"/features/\">Wishly features</a><a href=\"/faq/\">Frequently asked</a><a href=\"/about/\">About Wishly</a></div>\n<div class=\"footer-link-group\"><h4>Wishly</h4><a href=\"https://wishly.bd/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Main Wishly website ↗</a><a href=\"https://wishly.bd/templates/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Browse templates ↗</a><a href=\"https://wishly.bd/create/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Create a website ↗</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"footer-bottom\"><span>© 2026 Wishly Guide. All rights reserved.</span><span>Part of the <a href=\"https://wishly.bd/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Wishly</a> experience.</span></div>\n<div class=\"container footer-legal-links\"><a href=\"/privacy/\">Privacy</a><a href=\"/terms/\">Terms</a><a href=\"/editorial-policy/\">Editorial policy</a><a href=\"/contact/\">Contact</a></div>\n</div>\n</footer><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"reading-progress\"></div><button aria-label=\"Back to top\" class=\"back-top\" type=\"button\">↑</button>",
